      "description": "As a\n Site Admin or Site Merchandiser, \n\n\nI want \nto configure and manage country-to-currency mappings in SFCC Business Manager, \n\n\nso that \nshoppers are automatically shown prices in the correct currency for their country when they land on a storefront.\nKnown country-currency mappings (at time of writing):\nAU storefront — AUD\nUS storefront — USD\nUK storefront — GBP\nEU Domestic storefront — EUR (all countries)\nEU International storefront — EUR (default); Global-e handles currency display for international markets\nHK storefront — HKD\nME storefront — to be confirmed",
